# broiler-wasm retained suite pin 1
#
# A pin this repository holds for the WebAssembly specification's core test scripts. `revision` is the
# immutable upstream commit - never a branch name - and `content-sha256` is the digest over every path
# and content the archive extracts to under test/core, computed as the JavaScript conformance harness
# computes its suites' digests: SHA-256 over one "path\nsha256\n" pair per file, the paths relative to
# test/core with forward slashes, ordered by their UTF-8 bytes, each sha256 the lower-case hexadecimal
# digest of the file's bytes.
#
# HOW IT WAS TAKEN. On 2026-09-28, on the WebAssembly profile owner's direction, twice and by two paths:
# a sparse git clone of github.com/WebAssembly/spec at the tag wg-1.0, which names this commit directly,
# and each of the 76 files of test/core fetched one by one from raw.githubusercontent.com at the commit
# itself. The two were byte-identical. The archive is `git archive --format=tar.gz -9` of test/core at
# the commit, built twice to the same bytes, and extracts to the same 76 files.
#
# WHAT IS HERE. The archive, unmodified material under the Apache License 2.0 that the upstream
# repository's test/LICENSE states, which is retained beside it. The harness root reads the extracted
# test/core directory given to it on a command line, and checks it against this pin before reading any
# script.

suite wasm-spec-core
upstream WebAssembly/spec
revision 977f97014c962f7bd1291fcc6d28b41a924882bf
tag wg-1.0
path test/core
archive git archive --format=tar.gz -9 977f97014c962f7bd1291fcc6d28b41a924882bf test/core
archive-sha256 cf95b3fe7a0aca7a30f95c181506bd6334590377dc1f8b373322af573f2b6126
content-sha256 f9b7af49430ea98e1a8f75b49d15d142450a73c0f6ed17f5f2fc890f1fc0af19
files 76
scripts 73
archived yes
archived-at src/tests/wasm/spec/wasm-spec-977f97014c962f7bd1291fcc6d28b41a924882bf-test-core.tar.gz
